+## 10. External platform basis
+
+The trusted-entry design follows GitHub's documented execution model: a run
+uses workflow code from the event-associated SHA/ref; `workflow_dispatch` may
+select a branch or tag; `workflow_run` runs at the default branch and can cross
+into a privileged context; and full commit SHAs are the safest reusable-workflow
+reference. See [Workflows](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/concepts/workflows-and-actions/workflows),
+[events that trigger workflows](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/reference/workflows-and-actions/events-that-trigger-workflows#workflow_run),
+and [reuse workflows](https://docs.github.com/en/actions/how-tos/reuse-automations/reuse-workflows).

